            "title": "中國汽車出口上半年穩步增長",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">海關總署數據指出，2026年上半年，中國汽車產品進出口總額達1,647.4億美元，按年增長25.5%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">其中，出口額為1,454.9億美元，按年增加33.0%；同期進口額則下跌11.8%，至192.5億美元。</p>\n<!-- slider begin -->\n<div class=\"fancy-slider\">\n<p class=\"fancy-gallery-tips\" style=\"font-weight: bold;font-size: 18px; margin: 0\">點擊看圖輯</p>\n<div class=\"fancy-main\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/08/screenshot_8493257_05.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/08/screenshot_8493257_05.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/08/screenshot_8493257_06.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/08/screenshot_8493257_06.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/08/screenshot_8493257_02.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/ho